WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.754
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Make a Study Plan.

2
00:00:06.054 --> 00:00:10.622
Create a weekly study plan with AI. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:18.846
Step one. Give the AI your goal, how much time you have, and your level. Ask for a table.

4
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:26.095
Step two. Read the plan. Is it realistic for you? A plan you cannot follow is not useful.

5
00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:32.118
Step three. Adjust it. For example, add a rest day and a weekly test.

6
00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:40.845
Step four. Copy the plan into a note, and follow it every day. AI makes the plan, but you do the learning.

7
00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:46.476
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:46.776 --> 00:00:50.343
Ask for a 7-day study plan for your next exam.

9
00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:52.155
Add one rest day.

10
00:00:52.455 --> 00:00:54.524
Print or save it, and start today.

11
00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:55.802
Well done!

